{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Therefore</b> — May HaShem grant Israel that they stand firm in distress at the time she gives birth, until this ruler and his kinsmen join with the children of Israel. And Yefet said: for He will give them — [meaning] the Messiah. And the sense is 'He will leave them,' as in: עַל כֵּן לֹא נְתַתִּיךָ (therefore I did not give you)."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:56.739705626Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}